<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>you've been a bad girl</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Artemas</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">yustyna</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">6Gron8VFcNPwj7ZamJe7Pt</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:01.316" end="00:03.066">Yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.066" end="00:04.765">Yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:04.765" end="00:07.115">Yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.115" end="00:10.536">I've been a bad girl, I've been in therapy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.536" end="00:14.003">Picking up the pieces, all the things you said to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.003" end="00:17.553">Your love's a drug like cocaine and jealousy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.553" end="00:21.504">You've been a bad girl, I've been a bad girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.504" end="00:24.367">You used to be so sweet</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.367" end="00:27.946">Couldn't keep your hands off me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.946" end="00:31.350">The moral stuff was less, you'll need</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.350" end="00:35.701">The coldest stars I've ever seen</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.701" end="00:37.459">You're givin' me somethin' (Somethin')</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.459" end="00:39.208">It's tellin' me nothin' (Nothin')</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.208" end="00:40.992">If somethin' did happen (Happen)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.992" end="00:42.492" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Somethin' would happen)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.978" end="00:45.578">You've been a bad girl, I've been in therapy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.578" end="00:49.078">Picking up the pieces, all the things you said to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.078" end="00:52.457">Your love's a drug like cocaine and jealousy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.457" end="00:56.096">You've been a bad girl, I've been a bad girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.096" end="00:59.595">You've been a bad girl, I've been a bad girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.595" end="01:03.895">You've been a bad girl, I've been a bad girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.895" end="01:07.468">I know your type, we stay up all night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.468" end="01:10.813">Looking for, "But," looking for, "Why"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.813" end="01:14.215">You're kissing my neck, touching my thigh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.215" end="01:17.069">Let's do this in private, let's do this tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.069" end="01:20.509">Meet me in the bathroom, it's alright</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.509" end="01:24.049">Lock the doors behind you, let's get high</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.049" end="01:30.987">Meet me in the bathroom, come get high with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.987" end="01:34.634">You've been a bad girl, I've been in therapy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.634" end="01:38.118">Picking up the pieces, all the things you said to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.118" end="01:41.626">Your love's a drug like cocaine and jealousy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.626" end="01:45.126">You've been a bad girl, I've been a bad girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.126" end="01:48.675">You've been a bad girl, I've been a bad girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.675" end="01:52.175">You've been a bad girl, I've been a bad girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.175" end="01:55.676">You've been a bad girl, I've been a bad girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.676" end="01:59.224">You've been a bad girl, I've been a bad girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.224" end="02:02.629">Meet me in the bathroom, it's alright</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.629" end="02:06.075">Lock the doors behind you, let's get high</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.075" end="02:14.075">Meet me in the bathroom, come get high with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.531" end="02:16.231">Yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.231" end="02:18.030">Yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.030" end="02:22.030">Yeah</p></div></body></tt>